; One variable: the paragraph direction of a TextMesh, through `text_direction`, `language` and the
; structured override (primitive_meshes.cpp:3224-3238). `language` also picks the case map of
; `uppercase`. Only the glyph order changes: the block keeps its alignment and offset.

